msgid "ElevenLabs is unavailable."
msgstr "Níl ElevenLabs ar fáil."

msgid "Could not find the ElevenLabs driver"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir tiománaí ElevenLabs a aimsiú"

msgid "No API key found"
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh eochair API"

msgid "Fetching usage"
msgstr "Úsáid á fáil"

msgid "Could not fetch usage, see the NVDA log"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an úsáid a fháil, féach ar loga NVDA"

msgid "Unexpected response from ElevenLabs"
msgstr "Freagra gan choinne ó ElevenLabs"

msgid "Credits used: {used} of {limit} ({percent}%)."
msgstr "Creidmheasanna úsáidte: {used} as {limit} ({percent}%)."

msgid "Credits used: {used}."
msgstr "Creidmheasanna úsáidte: {used}."

msgid "Resets: {when}."
msgstr "Athshocrú: {when}."

msgid "Plan: {tier}."
msgstr "Plean: {tier}."

msgid "Checking voices and models"
msgstr "Guthanna agus samhlacha á seiceáil"

msgid "A check is already running"
msgstr "Tá seiceáil ar siúl cheana féin"

msgid "Voices and models will be checked next time you select ElevenLabs"
msgstr ""
"Seiceálfar guthanna agus samhlacha an chéad uair eile a roghnaíonn tú "
"ElevenLabs"

msgid "Could not update the ElevenLabs settings file"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir comhad socruithe ElevenLabs a nuashonrú"

msgid ""
"Check finished. Usable voices: {voices}. Unusable voices: {unusableVoices}. "
"Usable models: {models}. Unusable models: {unusableModels}."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil críochnaithe. Guthanna inúsáidte: {voices}. Guthanna nach féidir a "
"úsáid: {unusableVoices}. Samhlacha inúsáidte: {models}. Samhlacha nach "
"féidir a úsáid: {unusableModels}."

msgid "ElevenLabs speech synthesizer"
msgstr "Sintéiseoir cainte ElevenLabs"

msgid "Report ElevenLabs credit usage for the current period"
msgstr "Tuairiscigh úsáid creidmheasanna ElevenLabs don tréimhse reatha"

msgid "Check again which ElevenLabs voices and models this account can use"
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil arís cé na guthanna agus na samhlacha ElevenLabs is féidir leis an "
"gcuntas seo a úsáid"

msgid "ElevenLabs API Key"
msgstr "Eochair API ElevenLabs"

msgid "&API key:"
msgstr "Eochair &API:"

msgid "Paste your ElevenLabs API key first."
msgstr "Greamaigh d'eochair API ElevenLabs ar dtús."

msgid "Checking the API key with ElevenLabs..."
msgstr "Eochair API á seiceáil le ElevenLabs..."

msgid "The API key could not be checked. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an eochair API a sheiceáil. Féach ar loga NVDA le haghaidh sonraí."

msgid "The API key could not be saved. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an eochair API a shábháil. Féach ar loga NVDA le haghaidh sonraí."

msgid "ElevenLabs TTS"
msgstr "ElevenLabs TTS"

msgid "Clear &API key"
msgstr "Glan an eochair &API"

msgid "Set &API key..."
msgstr "Socraigh eochair &API..."

msgid "Clear the ElevenLabs API key? ElevenLabs can't speak until a new key is set."
msgstr "An bhfuil fonn ort an eochair API ElevenLabs a ghlanadh? Ní féidir le ElevenLabs labhairt go dtí go socraítear eochair nua."

msgid "The API key could not be cleared. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an eochair API a ghlanadh. Féach ar loga NVDA le haghaidh sonraí."

msgid "ElevenLabs rejected this API key. Check that it was copied in full and that it is allowed to read voices."
msgstr "Dhiúltaigh ElevenLabs don eochair API seo. Seiceáil gur cóipeáladh go hiomlán í agus go bhfuil cead aici guthanna a léamh."

msgid "ElevenLabs could not check the key (HTTP {code}). Try again later."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir le ElevenLabs an eochair a sheiceáil (HTTP {code}). Bain triail eile as ar ball."

msgid "Could not reach ElevenLabs to check the key. Check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir teagmháil a dhéanamh le ElevenLabs chun an eochair a sheiceáil. Seiceáil do nasc idirlín agus bain triail eile as."

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Speech synthesizer driver that streams audio from the ElevenLabs text-to-speech API."
msgstr "Tiománaí sintéiseora cainte a shruthaíonn fuaim ó API téacs-go-caint ElevenLabs."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"All settings and messages within the add-on are now localized.\n"
"If the ElevenLabs API suddenly becomes unavailable during a session, NVDA now reverts to using eSpeak instead of becoming silent."
msgstr ""
"Tá gach socrú agus teachtaireacht sa bhreiseán logánaithe anois.\n"
"Má éiríonn API ElevenLabs dofhaighte go tobann le linn seisiúin, filleann NVDA ar eSpeak anois in ionad dul ina thost."

#. Translators: spoken when neither the synthesizer chosen for navigation nor eSpeak can be loaded.
msgid "Could not load a synthesizer for navigation; using ElevenLabs for all speech."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir sintéiseoir a lódáil don nascleanúint; úsáidtear ElevenLabs don chaint ar fad."

#. Translators: spoken when the synthesizer chosen for navigation can't be loaded,
#. e.g. "Could not load Microsoft OneCore; using eSpeak NG for navigation."
msgid "Could not load {synth}; using {fallback} for navigation."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir {synth} a lódáil; úsáidtear {fallback} don nascleanúint."

#. Translators: spoken when ElevenLabs stops working and the synthesizer chosen
#. for navigation reads say all instead, e.g. "...say all will use eSpeak NG."
msgid "ElevenLabs is unavailable; say all will use {synth}."
msgstr "Níl ElevenLabs ar fáil; úsáidfidh léamh iomlán {synth}."

#. Translators: the choice in the ElevenLabs TTS settings for using no other synthesizer.
msgid "None (ElevenLabs speaks everything)"
msgstr "Dada (labhraíonn ElevenLabs gach rud)"

#. Translators: label of the box in the ElevenLabs TTS settings choosing the synthesizer
#. that speaks everything except say all, so only say all uses ElevenLabs credits.
msgid "&Synthesizer for navigation:"
msgstr "&Sintéiseoir don nascleanúint:"

#. Translators: description of a command in Input Gestures.
msgid "Switches between a separate synthesizer for navigation and ElevenLabs for all speech"
msgstr "Athraíonn idir sintéiseoir ar leith don nascleanúint agus ElevenLabs don chaint ar fad"

#. Translators: spoken when switching to a navigation synthesizer before one was ever chosen.
msgid "No navigation synthesizer chosen; choose one in ElevenLabs TTS settings"
msgstr "Níl aon sintéiseoir nascleanúna roghnaithe; roghnaigh ceann i socruithe ElevenLabs TTS"

#. Translators: spoken when ElevenLabs goes back to speaking everything.
msgid "Using ElevenLabs for all speech."
msgstr "Ag úsáid ElevenLabs don chaint ar fad."

#. Translators: spoken when a separate synthesizer takes over everything but say all,
#. e.g. "Using eSpeak NG for navigation."
msgid "Using {synth} for navigation."
msgstr "Ag úsáid {synth} don nascleanúint."

#. Translators: a setting in the settings ring while a synthesizer for navigation is
#. loaded, so either synthesizer's can be told apart, e.g. "eSpeak NG rate".
msgid "{synth} {setting}"
msgstr "{synth} {setting}"
